  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the sliced onion and cook until crispy, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "add the butter beans, paprika, salt, and black pepper. cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "add the cooked rice to the skillet and stir to combine with the butter beans and spices.",
    "add the wine to the skillet and stir to combine. cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "transfer the fried rice to a serving platter and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
